# .env.example
# JABIR MAHMUD KAWSAR — Graphic Design Portfolio
#
# This project is a fully static SPA. There are NO required runtime
# environment variables for the current build.
#
# All configurable values (designer info, URLs, email) are stored in:
#   src/config/siteConfig.ts
#
# If you add a backend contact API or third-party email service
# in the future, document the variable names here with safe placeholder values.
# NEVER put real secrets in this file.
#
# Example for a future EmailJS / Resend / SendGrid integration:
# VITE_EMAIL_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
# VITE_EMAIL_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
# VITE_EMAIL_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
#
# Example for a future Sanity CMS integration:
# VITE_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
# VITE_SANITY_DATASET=production
#
# Reminder: Variables starting with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
# Never place private server-side secrets in VITE_ variables.
